  not show up to the performance and he  started crying on stage due to the  obvious conclusion that moment of him  crying on stage it hurt like it really  hurt because it tells the whole story  without any story needing to be told and  I completely understand that feeling of  like Dread you know the whole knowing  that something isn't okay but still  trying to grasp on to any potential of  Hope regardless in retrospect I also  find it incredibly morbid that the first  exciting image that tagashi posted on  Twitter turned out to be the tree that  held sarasa's remains Togashi you are an  absolute dick wizard meaning the  internet went insane with hype due to  that image of the tree and to know that  it was all leading to this makes me feel  really really kind of stained because I  retweeted that damn tree and now just ah  what have I done the message  accompanying sarasa's body is something  that I don't think will ever be revealed  to us it's written in a gibberish  language that I don't think is meant to  be understood at least not by the  readers however if I had to guess it  would be a detailed description of  everything The Killers did to sarasa at  the moment I can't think of any other  reason why crawler would refuse to tell  everyone else what it says and since the  killers are just so proud of their work  I think it does make sense they would  want the details as well known as  possible and this this is one of those  sinking moments because it's not until  later in the chapter when you see all of  the evidence collected in the plastic  bags which includes at least seven  different kinds of knives all stained  with sarasa's blood like this is  legitimately sickening The Killers left  the murder implements behind on purpose  they did so so that whoever found the  body knew in excruciating detail exactly  what happened who it happened to and  exactly how it happened it was probably  one of the worst possible ways to die  imaginable back to the note though as  